---
title: "UML Sequence Diagram — Simulated Buy/Sell Trade"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as React Client
  participant API as Express API
  participant MW as Auth + CSRF + Zod
  participant PS as PortfolioService
  participant MS as MarketService
  participant C as Cache
  participant CG as CoinGecko
  participant DB as MongoDB

  U->>FE: Enter amount, click "Simulate buy"
  FE->>API: POST /api/portfolio/trades {side, usd|btc}<br/>cookie + X-Requested-With
  API->>MW: verify JWT cookie, CSRF header, validate body
  alt invalid / not logged in
    MW-->>FE: 400 / 401 / 403 error
  end
  MW->>PS: executeTrade(userId, order)
  PS->>MS: getBtcSnapshot()
  MS->>C: cached("btc-snapshot", 60s)
  alt cache miss
    C->>CG: GET /coins/bitcoin
    CG-->>C: market data
  end
  C-->>MS: price + freshness
  MS-->>PS: priceCents
  alt price unavailable or stale
    PS-->>FE: 503 "trading paused"
  end
  loop up to 3 attempts (optimistic concurrency)
    PS->>DB: read Portfolio
    PS->>PS: computeTrade() — integer cents & sats,<br/>fee, average-cost P&L, balance checks
    alt insufficient cash / BTC
      PS-->>FE: 400 INSUFFICIENT_CASH / BTC
    end
    PS->>DB: findOneAndUpdate(only if unchanged, $inc balances)
  end
  PS->>DB: insert SimulatedTrade
  PS-->>API: trade + updated portfolio
  API-->>FE: 201 {trade, portfolio summary}
  FE-->>U: "Simulated buy filled", refresh P&L and history
